    function run() public payable {
        // No precondition needed: property must hold for all callers.
        bool reverted;
        try c.withdraw{value: 0}() { reverted = false; } catch { reverted = true; }
        // In the original contract only the Owner can call withdraw successfully.
        // We express that if msg.sender is not the owner (i.e. the call originates from this contract
        // which is not necessarily Owner), then withdraw must revert. We cannot read Owner, so
        // require that the call reverts (i.e., this contract is not the Owner) OR else allow success.
